<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dīmensĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		dimetior, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a measuring</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quadrati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 1, 24, 57</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the axis of the
				earth</i>, Hygin. Astr. 1, 3.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Extent, dimensions</i>, in gen.,
					<i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6, 36</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">2, 2, 3 al.</span></i>—So plur.
			<i><span class="en">Amm. 23, 6,
			11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vocum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 9, 4, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">versuum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
				48</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 52</span></i> and 85.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
